## 🔐 10. Safety Notes

- Perform investigations on your own computer or an authorized lab.
- Use read-only commands during initial triage.
- Do not execute suspicious scripts or encoded commands.
- PowerShell logs can contain sensitive data; redact it before publishing screenshots.
- Follow organizational policies before changing logging settings.
- Do not fabricate logs, alerts, or investigation results.

